note =========================================================================
note d (3): router_top8_256_fast -- 1-launch 256-expert Softmax + Top-8 + Renormalize
note Args: logits[256] (R0:1), ids[8] (R2:3), wts[8] (R4:5).
note Grid: (1, 1, 1), Block: 256, SMEM: 2048 (scores[256] at 0, scratch[8] at 1024).
note =========================================================================
fn qRouterTop8Fast to void
qStart 3
note Load logits[tid] into R20
qicImm 9 16 14 0 4 qW1
qic 11 20 16 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
note Warp max -> SMEM[1024 + warp*4]
qicImm 8 21 20 QZ 1 qAlu4
qWarpBflyMax 21 52
qic 17 22 14 QZ 5 qAlu4
qic 18 23 14 QZ 31 qAlu4
qLit 57 1
bM = qBssy
qic 28 QZ 23 57 0 qCmp
skM = qBraFwd 1
qLit 58 1024
qMad 53 22 4 58
qic 50 QZ 53 21 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
qPatch skM 1
qBsync bM
qBar
note Block max across 8 warps
qNum 24 -1000000000.0f32
for w ulong 8
qLit 58 add 1024 mul w 4
qic 49 52 58 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qic 37 24 24 52 0 qAlu4
end
note exp(logit - max) -> R25, store into SMEM[tid*4]
qNum 55 1.4426950408889634f32
qic 31 25 20 24 0 qAlu4
qExp 25 25 55
qMad 53 14 4 QZ
qic 50 QZ 53 25 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
note Warp sum -> SMEM[1024 + warp*4]
qicImm 8 26 25 QZ 1 qAlu4
qWarpBflySum 26 52
bS = qBssy
qic 28 QZ 23 57 0 qCmp
skS = qBraFwd 1
qLit 58 1024
