qic 17 52 14 QZ 4 qAlu4
qic 18 39 14 QZ 15 qAlu4
qMad 36 15 32 QZ
qMad 36 52 2 36
qLit 59 0xffffffff
qIadd 59 21 59
note wRowU32 = K >> 3 (R12), sRowU32 = K >> 6 (R13), nIters = K >> 9 (R33)
qic 17 12 20 QZ 3 qAlu4
qic 17 13 20 QZ 6 qAlu4
qic 17 33 20 QZ 9 qAlu4
qMad 58 39 4 QZ
qic 17 37 39 QZ 1 qAlu4
qic 18 38 39 QZ 1 qAlu4
note Row 0 W ptr -> R0:1, S ptr -> R10:11
qMad 52 36 1 QZ
qic 28 QZ 52 21 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 1
qMad 52 59 1 QZ
qMadReg 32 52 12 58
qicImm 9 0 32 2 4 qAlu4
qMadReg 32 52 13 37
qicImm 9 10 32 4 4 qAlu4
note Row 1 W ptr -> R2:3, S ptr -> R4:5
qLit 52 1
qIadd 52 36 52
qic 28 QZ 52 21 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 1
qMad 52 59 1 QZ
qMadReg 32 52 12 58
qicImm 9 2 32 2 4 qAlu4
qMadReg 32 52 13 37
qicImm 9 4 32 4 4 qAlu4
note SMEM x offset = lane * 128 bytes (R32)
qMad 32 39 128 QZ
qNum 48 0.0f32
qNum 49 0.0f32
qLit 34 0
qLit 35 1
mLoop = get q36Pc 0
qic 57 24 0 QZ 0 qLdW1
qic 57 28 2 QZ 0 qLd
qic 11 50 10 QZ 0 qLd
qic 11 51 4 QZ 0 qLd
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW0
qicImm 8 52 50 QZ 65536 qAlu1
qic 18 53 50 QZ 0xffff0000 qAlu4
qic 28 QZ 38 35 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 1
qicImm 8 52 53 QZ 1 qAlu4
qicImm 8 54 51 QZ 65536 qAlu1
qic 18 55 51 QZ 0xffff0000 qAlu4
qic 28 QZ 38 35 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 1
qicImm 8 54 55 QZ 1 qAlu4
qicImm 8 6 52 QZ 1 qAlu1
qicImm 8 7 54 QZ 1 qAlu4
qW4G8Mac2 32 6 7
qicImm 9 0 35 0 256 qAlu1
qicImm 9 2 35 2 256 qAlu1
qicImm 9 10 35 10 32 qAlu1
qicImm 9 4 35 4 32 qAlu1
qLit 58 2048
qIadd 32 32 58
qIadd 34 34 35
qic 28 QZ 34 33 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 2
qic 46 QZ QZ QZ sub mLoop get q36Pc 0 qAlu4
qWarpRedSum 48 52 8
qWarpRedSum 49 52 8
qic 28 QZ 39 35 0 qCmp
put q36Guard 0 1
qic 45 QZ QZ QZ 0 qSafe
qic 28 QZ 36 21 0 qCmp
sk0 = qBraFwd 1
qicImm 9 16 36 8 4 qAlu4
qic 12 QZ 16 48 0 qSt
qic 0 QZ QZ QZ 0 qW1
qPatch sk0 1
qLit 52 1
qIadd 36 36 52
qic 28 QZ 36 21 0 qCmp
sk1 = qBraFwd 1
